            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.18.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 18:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Danieli owaayetsirwe Beliteeshaza yaamara omwanya muhango ashobeirwe, ayemereize omutima ahabw'ebiteekateeko bye. Omugabe yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Iwe Beliteeshaza, ekyo kirooto n'amakuru gaakyo birekye kukwemereza omutima. Beliteeshaza yaamugarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, ekyo kirooto nikikabe aha barikukwanga, n'amakuru gaakyo nigakabe aha bazigu baawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu ekyo kiti ki oreebire nikikura, kikahama, omutwe gwakyo gukahika omu iguru, kikareebwa ab'aha muheru gw'ensi yoona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.4.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 4:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " n'amababi gaakyo gakabengyeya, kikagira ebijuma bingi, kikabamu eby'okurya ebirikuhaazya abantu boona, kandi enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa zikabona ekicuucu ahansi yaakyo, amahungu g'omu mwanya gakatuura omu mataagi gaakyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.27.6+JER.27.7+JER.27.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 27:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.31.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 31:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyakusinga, ekyo kiti niiwe. Okakura, waahama, obukuru bwawe bwayeyongyera bwahika omu iguru, n'obutegyeki bwawe bwahika aha muheru gw'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi, nk'oku omugabe areebire orikwera ogizirwe omurinzi naashuuma naaruga omu iguru, akagira ati: Tema ekyo kiti, okimareho; kwonka ekitsintsi n'emizi yaakyo obibohese ebyoma n'emiringa, obirekye omu itaka omu bunyaatsi bw'omuroba obw'omu ishwa, kigume nikitondwaho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, kandi kirye n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa, kigume kityo okumara omwanya nk'ogw'emyaka mushanju; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbwenu Nyakusinga, amakuru gaakyo nigo aga. Omanye ku kiri ekiragiro kya Rukira-boona, ekyahika ahari mukama wangye omguabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 5:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Noija kubingwa omu bantu, otaahe n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa, orye obunyaatsi nk'ente, otondweho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, omare omwanya nk'ogw'emyaka mushanju ori otyo, okuhitsya obu orimanya ngu Rukira-boona niwe ategyeka obugabe bw'abantu, akabuha ou arikwenda weena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nk'oku baragiire kureka ekitsintsi n'emizi y'ekyo kiti, nikwo obugabe bwawe burikwija kukurindirwa, okuhitsya obu orimanya ngu Eiguru niryo ritegyeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
