              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo, Nyakusinga, ninkushaba oikirize obwengye obu ndikukuha; omareho ebibi byawe ahabw'okukora eby'okuhikiirira, kandi ebicumuro byawe obiihiseho okugirira abarikuhatwa embabazi, obundi okuba gye kwawe kukaabaasa kwongyerwaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
