          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima ebyo byona byahika aha mugabe. Nebukadeneeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku haahingwire ameezi ikumi n'abiri, eizooba rimwe omugabe akaba naagyendagyenda aha mutwe gw'enju, nyarufu y'obugabe bwa Babulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 5:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaagira ati: Babulooni egi yoona t'ei naayombekire n'amaani g'obushoboorozi bwangye kandi n'ekitiinisa ky'obukuru bwangye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebyo bigambo ku byabaire bitakarugire mu kanwa k'omugabe, eiraka ryaruga omu iguru nirigira riti: Iwe mugabe 'we Nebukadeneeza, niiwe orikugambirwa. Obugabe bwawe bwakwihwaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 5:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " noija kubingwa omu bantu, otuure n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa; noija kurya obunyaatsi nk'ente; kandi omare omwanya nk'ogw'emyaka mushanju ori otyo, okuhitsya obu orimanya ku Rukira-boona niwe ategyeka obugabe bw'abantu, akabuha ou arikwenda weena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho ekigambo ekyo kyahikiirira ahari Nebukadeneeza, yaabingwa omu bantu, yaaguma naarya obunyaatsi nk'ente, omubiri gwe nigutondwaho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, okuhitsya obu eishokye rye ryakuzire rikaba nk'amooya g'eishamba, n'ebyara bye bikashokoza n'eby'enyonyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
