        {
          "text": " Bwanyima y'ebyo biro, nyowe Nebukadeneeza nkaimutsya amaisho gangye ahainguru, naagarukwamu akengye, naasiima Rukira-boona, naahimbisa Otahwaho ebiro byona, naamuha ekitiinisa;",
